Conflux is an independent implementation. It re-implements ideas and documented
behaviour from the following projects; no source code from them is included.

- Hermes Agent — Nous Research — MIT — https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
  (learning loop, curated memory, skills, frozen prompts, session search, cron, gateways)
- OpenBot — CopilotKit — MIT — https://github.com/CopilotKit/OpenBot
  (AG-UI coworkers, policy gateway semantics, audit, take-control)
- OpenDots — CopilotKit — MIT — https://github.com/CopilotKit/OpenDots
  (Spaces, revisioned pages, scheduled turns, per-agent MCP)
- OpenMuse — CopilotKit — MIT — https://github.com/CopilotKit/openmuse
  (visible tasks, plans, approvals, follow-up queue)
- Dify — LangGenius — modified Apache 2.0 — https://github.com/langgenius/dify
  (workflow node model and knowledge datasets, as concepts only; no Dify code,
  frontend, logo or branding is used)
- agent-computer-use — Kortix — MIT — https://github.com/kortix-ai/agent-computer-use
  (accessibility-tree snapshot/ref model; Conflux invokes the agent-cu CLI if installed)

Skill files follow the open agentskills.io format. AG-UI is an open protocol
(https://docs.ag-ui.com).
